  "description": "Connects the OASIS to the Ceramic Network decentralised data protocol via the Ceramic HTTP API. Maps DIDs to OASIS Avatars and Ceramic streams to OASIS Holons. Supports ComposeDB queries. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
